  "3-4": { overview: ["Jupiter personal energy meets Rahu destiny — expressive and expansive nature combined with a life path full of disruption and unconventional turns.", "Your natural optimism and communication gifts give you the resilience to navigate Rahu's unpredictable destiny path without losing momentum.", "Your greatest creative breakthroughs consistently arrive through the unexpected detours — the disruptions are always pointing somewhere important."], personality: ["Creative, unconventional, and instinctively drawn to ideas and expressions that challenge existing thinking and established norms.", "You have a restless intellectual energy that needs constant new input, ideas, and challenges to stay genuinely engaged.", "Most fulfilled when expressing something genuinely original — repeating what already exists leaves you creatively dissatisfied."], career: ["Strongest in creative, disruptive, or forward-thinking fields — content creation, innovation, alternative media, and unconventional education.", "Your path will look non-linear and your ideas sometimes ahead of their time — both are signs you are on the right track.", "Building a creative output that challenges conventions while remaining genuinely communicative is your most powerful professional direction."], health: ["Rahu-Jupiter combination creates nervous system stimulation and a tendency toward mental overactivity and scattered physical energy.", "You take on too many creative directions simultaneously and exhaust yourself — conscious limitation and completion are essential disciplines.", "Grounding practices, structured creative routines, adequate sleep, and reducing stimulant intake are key health priorities."] },
  "3-5": { overview: ["Jupiter personal energy meets Mercury destiny — both planets are communicative and intellectual, creating an exceptionally gifted and versatile mind.", "Expression, intelligence, and the ability to connect with diverse people are amplified across both your nature and your destiny path.", "You are built for ideas, communication, and movement — your greatest results come when your voice reaches the widest possible audience."], personality: ["Brilliantly communicative, intellectually curious, and naturally entertaining — you make even complex ideas feel engaging and accessible.", "You are equally gifted in writing, speaking, and thinking — and most effective when all three are working simultaneously.", "Most fulfilled in dynamic, idea-rich environments where communication, learning, and expression are consistently valued and rewarded."], career: ["Ideal for media, journalism, education, content creation, speaking, writing, and any field built on clear and engaging communication.", "Your combination of intellectual depth and communicative versatility makes you effective across an unusually wide range of industries.", "A multi-platform or multi-format creative career is both natural and highly productive — breadth is genuinely your strength."], health: ["Double communicative energy creates a very active mind that struggles to switch off — mental fatigue and overstimulation are consistent risks.", "Nervous system health, respiratory function, and sleep quality all need conscious and regular attention from you.", "Regular mental rest, physical movement, time in nature, and genuine periods of silence are essential health practices."] },
  "3-6": { overview: ["Jupiter personal energy meets Venus destiny — expressive, expansive nature combined with a life path that rewards beauty, harmony, and meaningful relationships.", "Your natural warmth and communication gifts find their deepest expression through creative work that is also genuinely beautiful and relational.", "Your greatest results come when your ideas are expressed with both intellectual depth and genuine aesthetic and emotional sensitivity."], personality: ["Warm, creative, and socially gifted — you move through the world with a natural charm that makes people feel genuinely welcomed.", "You have strong aesthetic sensibilities alongside your intellectual gifts — beauty in all forms is genuinely important to your wellbeing.", "Most fulfilled when your creative expression is both intellectually rich and emotionally and aesthetically resonant for its audience."], career: ["Strongest in roles combining creative expression with beauty and relationships — arts, design, education, counseling, and luxury industries.", "Your warmth, creativity, and communication ability create exceptional client relationships and a deeply loyal professional community.", "Building a career with genuine beauty, heart, and meaningful human connection at its centre is your most fulfilling direction."], health: ["Venus-Jupiter combination creates a strong tendency toward pleasure-seeking and overindulgence — discipline around food and lifestyle is essential.", "Liver health, kidney function, hormonal balance, and weight management all need consistent and conscious attention.", "Joyful creative activity, loving relationships, moderate indulgence, and regular physical movement are your most effective health anchors."] },
  "3-7": { overview: ["Jupiter personal energy meets Ketu destiny — expressive, expansive nature combined with a life path that consistently rewards depth, wisdom, and inner development.", "Your natural gift for communication becomes most powerful when grounded in genuine knowledge and spiritual or philosophical depth.", "Your greatest results come when you teach and express from a place of real understanding rather than surface-level enthusiasm alone."], personality: ["Intellectually deep and communicatively gifted — you have both the wisdom to understand and the ability to express it clearly.", "You have a philosophical dimension to your thinking that most people sense but few can fully match in conversation with you.", "Most fulfilled when your communication carries genuine depth and meaning — superficial expression consistently leaves you unsatisfied."], career: ["Built for philosophy, spiritual teaching, research, writing, psychology, and fields combining depth of knowledge with quality of expression.", "Your ability to understand deeply and then communicate that understanding accessibly is one of the rarest professional gifts.", "A career built on genuine knowledge, meaningful teaching, and the communication of wisdom is your most fulfilling long-term direction."], health: ["Ketu-Jupiter combination creates a tendency to live in the mind and neglect the body — physical grounding is a consistent essential discipline.", "Nervous system health, digestive function, and respiratory health all need regular conscious attention alongside intellectual pursuits.", "Time in nature, regular physical movement, adequate nutrition, and periods of genuine mental stillness are your most important health practices."] },
