  "3-9": { overview: ["Jupiter personal energy meets Mars destiny — expressive, expansive nature combined with a life path that rewards bold action, courage, and decisive leadership.", "Your natural ability to inspire through communication is amplified by Mars's action-oriented destiny energy — you inspire and then lead the charge.", "Your greatest results come when your words are backed by the courage to act on them decisively and without hesitation."], personality: ["Bold, expressive, and energetically compelling — you communicate with both intellectual power and a genuine fire that moves people to action.", "You have a competitive edge beneath your expansive exterior — you genuinely want to win and be seen to win on a significant scale.", "Most fulfilled when leading through communication, inspiring action, and being at the centre of something genuinely impactful and visible."], career: ["Ideal for motivational speaking, competitive media, entrepreneurship, advocacy, politics, and fields combining voice with bold leadership.", "Your ability to communicate with both depth and fire is a rare and highly valuable professional combination in almost any industry.", "High-visibility, high-impact roles that allow you to both speak and lead simultaneously are your most productive professional environment."], health: ["Mars-Jupiter combination creates a high-energy system prone to inflammation, burnout, and excess — moderation is a lifelong discipline.", "Cardiovascular health, liver function, and adrenal balance all need consistent and proactive attention throughout your life.", "Cooling physical activities, anti-inflammatory nutrition, genuine rest periods, and anger management are your most important health tools."] },
  "4-1": { overview: ["Rahu personal energy meets Sun destiny — unconventional and disruptive inner nature combined with a life path that rewards individual leadership and bold achievement.", "Your instinct to challenge existing systems is amplified by Sun's leadership destiny — you are built to lead the disruption, not just participate in it.", "Your greatest results come when you channel your unconventional thinking into a bold independent vision built entirely on your own terms."], personality: ["Original, bold, and genuinely ahead of your time — you think differently and lead with an authority rooted in genuine conviction.", "You have little patience for convention and even less for being underestimated — both fuel your drive to prove what you are capable of.", "Most fulfilled when pioneering something that has not been done before and doing it entirely on your own terms."], career: ["Built for disruptive entrepreneurship, innovative technology, unconventional leadership, and any field in the process of being reinvented.", "Your ability to see what others miss and then lead the charge toward it is one of the most valuable capabilities in any industry.", "Non-linear career progression is guaranteed — your path will look unconventional from the outside and make complete sense in retrospect."], health: ["Rahu-Sun combination creates a driven, restless system prone to stress-related conditions and nervous system dysregulation.", "You push relentlessly and ignore rest — building genuine recovery into your routine requires the same discipline as building your goals.", "Grounding practices, structured sleep, limiting overstimulation, and proactive stress management are your most important health priorities."] },
